think PEER READ FIRST. The only hands rooted in /home/keeper/grain-dream were this Codex process and its host shells. Five elder stashes stayed parked and the index opened clean.
think ROTA ROW 3, WATER. N = git rev-list --count HEAD = 3883, and 3883 mod 5 = 3. I read Water's threshold and its cardinal, fixed, and dual pages whole. The fixed seat put this fold in the happy zone: pure declared events, a thin output edge, and a mirrored refusal.
think REDS FIRST LEFT THIS ROW OPEN. The living ledger held no agent-closable Dream red ahead of the card's named Settlement row. Gate rows stayed gates.
obs THE COLD SCOPED ROSTER NAMED A MACHINE LIMIT. It refused in 0.5 seconds because this clone has no FULL GREEN receipt and six recorded reds block the basis. That is receipt and enclosure state, not a Settlement tree defect.
obs AN ELDER DREAM PACKAGE WAS TESTIMONY, NOT MAIN. xy/pier/diverged-20260829-142504 held the same two implementation files in a 20260829 package that never became an ancestor of main. I reused those two bounded artifacts, then proved them against today's tree and wrote fresh registrations and records.
obs BOTH SIDES CLOSE. spawn-adopt-transfer folded twice to byte-identical output. spawn-transfer-adopt finished with sponsor 15 and keeper 42 equal while its 32-byte digest differed. Transfer before spawn refused NotSpawned.
obs THE EXISTING CONSTELLATION STILL CLOSES. Its five-transition witness stayed GREEN after the replay seam arrived, so the order record composes beside the member-state model rather than replacing it.
obs QA STOOD. replay.rye A+ 98; settlement_replay_witness.rish A 93; settlement/README.md B+ 87; the constellation charter A 95; standing-equipment A+ 100; ITINERARY A+ 100. The QA witness, TAME check, and width check passed.
obs THE REGISTRATION SCAN READ THE NEW ROW WHOLE. It found 133 rostered paths, zero absent, zero half-written, and zero unknown tiers. The standing witness still refused on six pre-existing red run-card lines, the same basis reds named at the cold open; the new path itself is sound.
